          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit is within engagement range of any enemy unit and none of your other units are within 4&quot; of this unit, for each attack made for this unit&apos;s Eviscerator weapons, that attack gains Critical Hits 5+.</characteristic>
