        <profile name="Pacifier Helmet" id="caf5-6bfa-6eea-73d4" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit is Activated, you may ‘utter its trigger word’. If you do, this unit gains the following abilities:

Resilient 6+

Frenzied Berserkers: This unit cannot capture objectives.

Disabled Pacifier: Each time this unit makes an Advance or Reposition move, it must end that move as close as possible to the closest enemy unit (If two or more units are closest, you choose).

Deadly Cocktail: For each attack made for this unit&apos;s Arco-flails, that attack gains Critical Hits 4+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
