          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While there are one or more friendly infantry units within 8&quot; of this unit, this unit&apos;s ranged weapons gain Suppressive 1 (if that weapon already has Suppressive X, improve X by 1 instead). After this unit is targeted by one or more ranged attacks, you may roll a D6. On a 3+, each ranged attack targeting this unit suffers a -1 penalty to its Hit Roll and you cannot roll for this ability again until the next battle round.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
